--[[
    ============================================================
    MADDISON ENTERPRISE UI LIBRARY - ULTRA EDITION (v3.5)
    Features: Procedural Shadows, HSV Color Pickers, Dropdowns, 
    Animated Sliders, Keybinds, Notifications, Tabs, and Sections.
    ============================================================
